### Login as the seeded admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Paste the login token here
@token = paste-token-here
@ticketId = paste-existing-ticket-id-here

### Update an existing ticket
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Cannot access email",
  "description": "The user cannot sign in to the company email account.",
  "category": "Email",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Invalid priority - should return 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Cannot access email",
  "description": "The user cannot sign in to the company email account.",
  "category": "Email",
  "priority": "URGENT",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}
